 "。抖音/微博/微信互动量需开放平台密钥且条款禁止抓取，故本页按「关键词命中数」排序，不展示热度值与参与量。": ". Interaction volume for Douyin / Weibo / WeChat requires open platform keys, and their terms prohibit scraping, so this page sorts by “keyword hits” and does not show heat values or participation volume.",
 "全国底图 · 聚焦山东 · 各市 A 级景区数量热力（普查口径）+ 重点监测景点客流点位（圆点按景区等级着色）；点圆点看客流画像，单击地市切换分析范围并细分县区": "National base map · Focused on Shandong · Grade A attraction count heat by city (census basis) + key monitored attraction visitor flow points (dots color-coded by attraction grade); click a dot for its visitor profile, click a city to switch the analysis scope and drill down to counties/districts",
 "全国底图 · 聚焦山东 · 各市按固定彩色区分、五颜六色（颜色只作区分，范围外地市灰显，数量见图上数字）+ 收录美食碗形标（按类别着色）；点碗形标定位到所属县区，单击地市切换分析范围并细分县区": "National base map · Focused on Shandong · Cities distinguished by fixed colors, in assorted hues (colors for distinction only; cities outside the scope greyed out; see the numbers on the map) + culinary entry bowl icons (color-coded by category); click a bowl icon to locate its county/district, click a city to switch the analysis scope and drill down to counties/districts",
 "全国底图 · 聚焦山东 · 各市自然保护区数量热力 + 保护区叶形标（按等级着色）与物种监测点；点叶形标看保护区详情，单击地市切换分析范围并细分县区": "National base map · Focused on Shandong · Nature reserve count heat by city + protected area leaf icons (color-coded by level) and species monitoring points; click a leaf icon for protected area details, click a city to switch the analysis scope and drill down to counties/districts",
 "全国底图 · 聚焦山东省 · 颜色越暖表示旅游热度越高 · 单位：万人次 · 统计周期：近30日": "National base map · Focused on Shandong Province · Warmer colors indicate higher tourism heat · Unit: ×10,000 visits · Statistical period: Last 30 days",
 "叶形标 = 保护区（按等级着色）；圆环 = 物种监测点（与保护区同址布设，按物种等级着色）": "Leaf icons = protected areas (color-coded by level); rings = species monitoring points (co-located with protected areas, color-coded by species level)",
 "按名录「申报地区」归属到县区，圆点大小 = 项目数（仅统计能归到县区的项目）；点左侧清单里的项目可定位到该县区。": "Attributed to counties/districts by directory “declared area”; dot size = number of projects (only projects that can be attributed to a county/district are counted); click a project in the list on the left to locate its county/district.",
 "清单为平台整理的山东饮食文化条目（鲁菜名菜 / 地方名吃 / 地理标志农产品 / 非遗美食），": "The list contains Shandong culinary culture entries compiled by the platform (famous Lu cuisine dishes / local specialty food / geographical indication agricultural products / intangible heritage food),",
 "游客整体评价较好，重点集中在景观体验、服务设施与交通便利性；高峰时段存在排队拥堵反馈。": "Overall visitor reviews are positive, focusing on the landscape experience, service facilities and transport convenience; queuing congestion is reported during peak hours.",
