 "济南三大名胜之首，趵突泉居七十二名泉之冠，三窟并发、四季恒温，素有「天下第一泉」之称。": "Foremost of Jinan's three great scenic spots and the finest of the 72 famous springs, Baotu Spring wells up from three outlets at a constant temperature year-round and has long been known as the “Number One Spring under Heaven.”",
 "济南本地": "Jinan local",
 "五岳之首，世界文化与自然双遗产，主峰玉皇顶海拔 1545 米，历代帝王封禅告祭之地。": "Foremost of the Five Great Mountains and a World Cultural and Natural Dual Heritage site; its main peak, Jade Emperor Summit, rises 1,545 m, and emperors of past dynasties came here to perform the Fengshan sacrifices.",
 "孔庙、孔府、孔林合称「三孔」，世界文化遗产，是儒家文化最完整的实物遗存。": "The Temple of Confucius, the Kong Family Mansion and the Cemetery of Confucius are together called the “Three Confucian Sites”; a World Cultural Heritage site, they are the most complete physical legacy of Confucian culture.",
 "山西": "Shanxi",
 "黄河入海处的新生湿地，芦花飞雪、河海交汇，是东方白鹳、黑嘴鸥等珍禽的繁殖地。": "Newly formed wetlands where the Yellow River meets the sea, with reed catkins flying like snow and river blending into ocean — a breeding ground for Oriental white storks, Saunders's gulls and other rare birds.",
 "由济南众泉汇流而成的天然湖泊，「四面荷花三面柳，一城山色半城湖」即咏此处。": "A natural lake formed by the convergence of Jinan's many springs; the verse “lotuses on four sides, willows on three; a city of mountain scenery, half of it lake” was written about this very place.",
 "济南三大名胜之一，古称历山，隋代崖壁造像千余尊，登顶可俯瞰泉城全景。": "One of Jinan's three great scenic spots, known in ancient times as Lishan; more than a thousand Sui-dynasty cliff carvings remain, and the summit offers a panorama of the City of Springs.",
 "南四湖中面积最大的湖泊湿地，荷花芦苇连片，也是南水北调东线的重要调蓄湖泊。": "The largest lake wetland among the Nansi Lakes, with unbroken stretches of lotus and reeds, and an important regulation lake on the eastern route of the South-to-North Water Diversion.",
 "《水浒传》故事发生地，梁山寨、忠义堂等遗迹尚存，是水浒文化旅游的核心景区。": "The setting of “Water Margin”; relics such as the Liangshan Stockade and the Hall of Loyalty and Righteousness still stand, making it the core scenic area of Water Margin cultural tourism.",
 "有「旱码头」之称的周村大街，保存完好的明清商业街市，瑞蚨祥等老字号的发源地。": "Zhoucun Street, known as the “Dry Port,” is a well-preserved Ming and Qing commercial street and the birthplace of time-honored brands such as Ruifuxiang.",
 "以《孙子兵法》为主题的仿古建筑群，位于兵圣孙武故里惠民县，是鲁北文旅地标。": "An ancient-style architectural complex themed on “The Art of War,” located in Huimin County, hometown of the military sage Sun Wu, and a cultural tourism landmark of northern Shandong.",
