 "潍坊朝天锅": "Weifang chaotian pot",
 "汤清味厚、现煮现卷": "Clear broth with deep flavor, cooked and wrapped to order",
 "朝天锅卷饼": "Chaotian pot wrap",
 "热汤": "Hot broth",
 "猪杂拼盘": "Pork offal platter",
 "朝天锅源于清代集市，锅无盖朝天而得名，卤汤煮猪下货现切现卷，就着热汤与咸菜，是潍坊的市井名片。": "Chaotian pot originated at Qing-dynasty market fairs and takes its name from the lidless pot facing the sky; pork offal is simmered in spiced broth, sliced and wrapped to order, and enjoyed with hot broth and pickles — a street-level icon of Weifang.",
 "潍县萝卜": "Weixian radish",
 "脆甜微辣、汁水充盈": "Crisp and sweet with mild heat, brimming with juice",
 "生食萝卜": "Raw radish",
 "萝卜丝拌海米": "Shredded radish with dried shrimp",
 "「烟台苹果莱阳梨，不如潍县萝卜皮」，潍县萝卜皮薄肉绿、甜脆多汁，是山东人冬日的当家果蔬。": "“Yantai apples and Laiyang pears are no match for Weixian radish skin”: Weixian radishes have thin skin, green flesh and sweet, crisp juiciness — the staple fruit-vegetable of a Shandong winter.",
 "济宁甏肉干饭": "Jining bengrou ganfan",
 "酱香软糯、油而不腻": "Soy-sauce richness, soft and sticky, oily but not greasy",
 "甏肉干饭": "Bengrou ganfan (clay-pot pork over rice)",
 "面筋丸子": "Gluten balls",
 "油皮卷": "Tofu skin rolls",
 "甏肉干饭用陶甏炖肉，加入面筋、丸子和海带同煮，浇在米饭上，是运河码头上流传百年的市井快餐。": "Bengrou ganfan braises pork in a clay pot with gluten, meatballs and kelp, then ladles it over rice — a street fast food that has circulated around the canal wharves for a century.",
 "曲阜熏豆腐": "Qufu smoked tofu",
 "熏香浓郁、外韧内嫩": "Rich smoky aroma, chewy outside and tender inside",
 "熏豆腐炖白菜": "Smoked tofu stewed with cabbage",
