 "熏豆腐以果木锯末熏制，色泽金黄、烟香入里，是孔府家常菜与地方集市小吃共同的常客。": "Smoked tofu is cured over fruitwood sawdust, golden in color with smoke flavor deep within; it is a regular in both Kong Mansion home cooking and local market snacks.",
 "泰山豆腐宴": "Mount Tai Tofu Banquet",
 "清素鲜醇、荤素两宜": "Light, pure and mellow, suited to vegetarian and meat dishes alike",
 "赤鳞鱼": "Mount Tai red scale fish",
 "白菜豆腐水": "Cabbage, tofu and spring water",
