 "卤汁豆腐": "Tofu in gravy",
 "高唐老豆腐比豆腐脑更紧实，浇上咸香微辣的卤子，是鲁西北清晨街头的第一缕热气。": "Gaotang laodoufu is firmer than tofu pudding; topped with a savory, mildly spicy gravy, it is the first wisp of steam on early-morning streets in northwestern Shandong.",
